  "content": "\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4IgKuSq.png\" alt=\"YUNG 的更优海洋神殿\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\" /><br />\n<a title=\"依赖 YUNG's API\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"加入 YUNG GANG 的 Discord！\" href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 YUNG GANG 的 Discord！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"订阅我的 YouTube 频道！\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的 YouTube 频道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\" /></a><br />\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qs5CKD3.png\" alt=\"这是什么？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\n对《我的世界》海洋神殿的全面重做！YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 从根本上重新设计了海洋神殿，使其更具趣味性和回报性。优化后的神殿比原版大得多，且布局完全随机。你的探索将获得更丰厚的战利品，包括三叉戟和海洋之心！\n</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QavgJ5oL5SI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/61NjpSv.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\nYUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-desert-temples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Mineshafts\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Strongholds\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-strongholds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Extras\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Bridges\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-bridges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Repurposed Structures。该模组还提供自定义数据包，可配合本模组使用，为这些重做的神殿添加复用版本！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-ocean-monuments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在此查看。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"使用 Essential 模组与好友联机！\" href=\"https://essential.gg/x/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"使用 Essential 模组与好友联机！\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\" /><br />\n<a title=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用优惠码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 购买服务器可享 25% 折扣！\" href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用优惠码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\" /></a></p>",
